#: constants/achievements.ts:427
msgid "THE EAGLE"
msgstr "OREL"

#: components/overlays/how-to-play-overlay.tsx:699
msgid "The fight itself costs nothing to stand in. Dialling at towers and warriors leaves the bar exactly where it was when the walls closed."
msgstr "Stát v boji samo o sobě nestojí nic. Navolování na věže a bojovníky nechá proužek přesně tam, kde byl, když se hradby zavřely."

#: lib/compare-lines.ts:38
msgid "The gap is not a gap. It is a floor and a ceiling."
